WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.264
You wrote it. But was it right? And if not, why not?

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:15.332
This is English tutor. It turns what you write, hear and read into English practice.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.904
Write a sentence the way you would say it.

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:30.185
Every change is marked, and every change is explained, with a translation into your own language.

00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:35.277
Hear the corrected sentence, in a British or an American voice.

00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:55.341
Going the other way? Write it in your own language, and get natural English back, with notes on how it is built.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:05.833
Open any recording, like a podcast, or a track from your course book.

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:17.525
It is transcribed right on your computer. Every line is timed, with a translation underneath.

00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:24.741
Press play, and read along. Tap any line to hear it again.

00:01:34.233 --> 00:01:37.281
Photograph an exercise from any book.

00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:49.445
The gaps become answer boxes, right beside the page.

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:55.921
Fill them in, and check. A mistake comes back with the reason.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:08.941
Or photograph something you want to read, and tap any word to see what it means, right there.

00:02:21.733 --> 00:02:24.949
In Study, open your own course book.

00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:32.341
It finds every unit, and the page where it starts.

00:02:34.733 --> 00:02:40.109
Draw a box round any exercise on the page, and it is written out for you to answer.

00:02:55.983 --> 00:02:59.415
Then let the plan say what to study, and when.

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:09.431
Every word you look up is saved, with its forms and the sentence you found it in.

00:03:13.983 --> 00:03:16.719
Then review them as flashcards.

00:03:20.383 --> 00:03:26.239
The curriculum holds every grammar lesson, level by level, with examples and drills.

00:03:35.302 --> 00:03:40.030
The tutor looks back at your work, and finds the mistakes you keep making.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:47.228
And you can ask it anything, from any screen.

00:03:55.278 --> 00:04:00.510
English tutor. Learn English from what you write, hear and read.

